  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a copper pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the tadka spice mix and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the diced tomato and cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the sliced cucumber and cook for 1 minute, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice, salt, and pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Warm the pita bread by wrapping it in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the gyro by spreading the feta cheese on the pita bread, then adding the hazelnuts and vegetable mixture.",
    "Serve the gyro hot, garnished with additional hazelnuts if desired."
